          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "`CatalogService::init` / `CatalogPort::init` reuse the full `CatalogError`, but the `init` verb can only plausibly emit file-creation and I/O failures. Callers still have to handle dead branches such as `DuplicateEntry`, `AnchorNotFound`, `InvalidRole`, `ParseFragment`, `SchemaInvalid`, and `DraftIncomplete`, and the method docs do not narrow that subset or justify the broad enum.",
