              "line": 5,
              "category": "task-contract attribution mismatch"
            },
            {
              "message": "`T002` explains why the commit must be atomic and why the lint shape matters. That's upstream rationale/behavior prose, not just target + operation + anchor cite, so it violates `knowledge/conventions/no-upstream-restatement.md`.",
