          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "AC-03 requires an `add` result with omitted shape nodes to contain `$todo` nodes and still pass catalogue schema validation. That conflicts with IN-07/AC-05, which define `$todo` as draft-layer data before the typed schema and require `try_complete` to return Err while any `$todo` remains. Downstream phases cannot tell whether incomplete generated entries should validate as completed catalogue DTOs or only as draft JSON.",
